{"id":"u149","kelas":"reader","no":8,"judul":"Tahap 8: Cerita Lebih Panjang","title":"Stage 8: Longer Stories","emoji":"🏆","ringkas":"Cerita lebih panjang dengan kalimat kompleks","ready":true,"goals":["membaca **cerita lebih panjang** (sekitar 200 kata)","mengikuti **alur dengan banyak tokoh dan waktu**","memahami **kalimat kompleks** dengan because, although, while","menyimpulkan **makna tersirat**"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Tahap 8: cerita lebih panjang dengan kalimat kompleks. Baca per paragraf, rangkum dengan satu kalimat, lalu lanjutkan ke paragraf berikutnya."},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Kata-kata cerita tahap 8","items":[{"en":"although","id":"walaupun","ex":"Although it was late, they kept working."},{"en":"while","id":"sementara / ketika","ex":"While she cooked, he cleaned."},{"en":"however","id":"namun","ex":"However, nobody believed him."},{"en":"determined","id":"bertekad","ex":"She was determined to win."},{"en":"struggle","id":"berjuang","ex":"He struggled to learn English."},{"en":"achieve","id":"mencapai","ex":"She achieved her goal."},{"en":"opportunity","id":"kesempatan","ex":"It was a great opportunity."},{"en":"realise","id":"menyadari","ex":"He realised he was wrong."},{"en":"gradually","id":"perlahan-lahan","ex":"Gradually, she became confident."},{"en":"encourage","id":"mendorong / menyemangati","ex":"Her teacher encouraged her."},{"en":"proud","id":"bangga","ex":"They were proud of her."},{"en":"journey","id":"perjalanan","ex":"It was a long journey."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Tentang perjuangan","lines":[{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"You studied hard this year, Rani.","id":"Kamu belajar keras tahun ini, Rani."},{"who":"Rani","en":"Thank you. At first it was difficult.","id":"Terima kasih. Awalnya sulit."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"But you did not give up.","id":"Tetapi kamu tidak menyerah."},{"who":"Rani","en":"My friends encouraged me.","id":"Teman-temanku menyemangatiku."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Cara menghafal","text":"Setelah satu cerita panjang, tulis ringkasan tiga kalimat: awal, masalah, akhir. Cek ulang dengan teks."},{"t":"summary","items":["Kata-kata cerita tahap 8: [[although]], [[while]], [[however]], [[determined]], [[struggle]], [[achieve]]."]}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"although\"?","options":["walaupun","namun","perjalanan","mencapai"],"answer":0,"exp":"although = walaupun.","k":"7b5834d2"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"walaupun\" adalah...","options":["although","realise","determined","proud"],"answer":0,"exp":"walaupun = although.","k":"1b7a1eaa"},{"type":"fill","id":"Isi dengan kata Inggris untuk \"walaupun\":","q":"___ it was late, they kept working.","answers":["although","although"],"hint":"a _ _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"walaupun = although.","k":"f0027683"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"while\"?","options":["sementara / ketika","walaupun","perjalanan","bertekad"],"answer":0,"exp":"while = sementara / ketika.","k":"887ffa5d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"sementara / ketika\" adalah...","options":["while","proud","although","realise"],"answer":0,"exp":"sementara / ketika = while.","k":"058c9724"},{"type":"fill","id":"Isi dengan kata Inggris untuk \"sementara / ketika\":","q":"___ she cooked, he cleaned.","answers":["while","while"],"hint":"w _ _ _ _","exp":"sementara / ketika = while.","k":"174931e5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"however\"?","options":["namun","walaupun","perjalanan","mencapai"],"answer":0,"exp":"however = namun.","k":"20068088"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"namun\" adalah...","options":["however","while","struggle","gradually"],"answer":0,"exp":"namun = however.","k":"d7c9652d"},{"type":"fill","id":"Isi dengan kata Inggris untuk \"namun\":","q":"___, nobody believed him.","answers":["however","however"],"hint":"h _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"namun = however.","k":"78bb9719"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"determined\"?","options":["bertekad","namun","sementara / ketika","menyadari"],"answer":0,"exp":"determined = bertekad.","k":"